== The Secretary Name National Archives ==

Welcome to the Secretary Name National Archives (named in honor of Secretary Name for their massive contributions), or National Archives for short – the pride and joy of SimDem's Archives Commission.

The National Archives aims to contain all the information on the current and past state of the experiment, but focuses on maintaining an accurate record of laws.

If you have any questions please contact the Archives Commission through the Discord channel #ac-bill-submission, or the Chief Archivist u/benbookworm97 on Reddit or diapason_ben on Discord. 

